- `Jakość` standing in for status. 4: 001 beneficial owner, 004 subsidiary, 017 shareholder/investor (FAQ and body). Product `jakość` in 011 was left; there it means quality.
- A digit glued into a time phrase, and `1 raz` read as "only once". 002: both FAQ and body, now `każdy okres zawieszenia działalności liczy się osobno i ten 1 okres nie może przekroczyć 1 roku` (the extra 1 is the Korean `1회`, which the checker still counts; it no longer means the company may suspend only once). 001: `za ostatni 1 rok` → `za ostatni jeden rok` (2; `jeden rok` is the form the checker parses). 008: `ukończone 1 rok` → `ukończony 1 rok` (2; the digit stays). 005: the headcount is now "more than 1 foreign national", not "more than 1 employee".
- English office and job lines in the Polish bios. 8 strings in the `pl` block of `international-guidance-team.ts` only: Legal Aid Foundation, both Ministry of Education lines, the paralegal intro, both Senior Paralegal lines, `na podstawie informatyki`, and the CPA degree sentence. Role labels: `Paralegal` → `Asystent prawny (paralegal)`; `Partner-księgowy (Partner CPA)` → `Wspólnik biura rachunkowego (Partner CPA)`. Firm names and the English glosses the reviewer kept in parentheses stayed. Other locales in that file were not touched.
